 id="main" tabindex="-1">

<h1>Search</h1>
<section class="lock" aria-labelledby="lock-title">
<h2 id="lock-title">Search needs a running server</h2>
<p>This blog is served as plain files, and plain files cannot look up words.</p>
<p>To turn search on, the site owner runs Khalid as a server: <code>khalid serve</code></p>
</section>
